Sampāti confesses daring sun-following to sage --- Brothers vow before sages to chase sun to setting hill --- Brothers see wheel-sized cities hear music and singing women --- Brothers rise to sun path viewing earth stones threads --- Brothers see Himālaya Vindhya Mēru like pond snakes --- Brothers suffer sweat fear delusion and lose directions --- Jaṭāyu plunges unasked and Sampāti shields him --- Sampāti burns falling while Jaṭāyu escapes scorching --- Sampāti falls wingless on Vindhya kinless longing death
